tinacloud-org-list(1) -- List organizations
===========================================

## DESCRIPTION

List all organizations tied to the current logged in TinaCloud user.

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud org list`

## OPTIONS

  * `--json`:
    Print the result as JSON

## EXAMPLES

List organisations available to the signed-in account:

	$ tinacloud org list

Print the same result as JSON:

	$ tinacloud org list --json

